the whole pipeline,

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:08.970
deploys your application,
but then stays open

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.740
and watches for
changes in your source,

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:14.215
and then redeploys every
time things change.

